      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "After some testings, you cannot use all old bindings anymore BEFORE August. The new bindings made in this month (August) will work normal.\n\nIf you saw your hands are not working good, then you must renew all binding settings, and re-config it again to suit your way.",
