  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-08-03T18:43:23.070Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Since latest build 825, even it's only audio upgrade, it seems my right hand is not working properly.\n\nEven restarted WMR and SteamVR doesn't help. But i heard a special controller config can fix it, but that is not what i mean. I test it too on another pc, and it showed exact same problem.\n\nVRChat must work in normal ways with WMR users, which means default bindings must work.\n\nI got more reports from others right hand gestures are not working good and it even start stuck in fist stand. When i move right joystick, my right hand showed normal open state, but gestures are not working.\n\nSo, please take a look at this problem and fix the problem. Build 801 has no problems, so something is broken in build 825.\n\nIt seems some users with Oculus has also same problems (i made reddit thread for it, see https://www.reddit.com/r/VRchat/comments/clk6wg/help_wmr_right_hand_controller_gestures_seems/) so it's not purely WMR users.",
